{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["讚美之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["到那日，你們必說：",{"text":"「耶和華啊，我要讚美你！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你雖然曾向我發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你的怒氣已經止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你還安慰了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，上帝是我的拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要倚靠祂，不會懼怕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華上帝是我的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我的詩歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂成了我的拯救者。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必從救恩的泉源歡然取水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，你們必說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「要稱頌耶和華，求告祂的名；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在萬民中傳揚祂的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣告祂的名配受尊崇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華成就了奇妙的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要向祂歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將祂的作為傳遍世界。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的居民啊，高聲歡呼吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為住在你們當中的以色列的聖者無比偉大。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}